  "solution": "Given equation: 352 × 8 − 330 + 125 ÷ 4 = 214.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) + and ×\n\nGiven: 352 × 8 − 330 + 125 ÷ 4 = 214\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 352 + 8 − 330 × __**125 ÷ 4**__ = 214\n\n⇒ 352 + 8 − __**330 **____**×**____** 31.25**__ = 214\n\n⇒ __**352 +**____** 8**__ − 10312.50 = 214\n\n⇒ __360 - 10312.50__ = 214\n\n⇒ -9952.5 ≠ 214\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) − and ÷\n\nGiven: 352 × 8 − 330 + 125 ÷ 4 = 214\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 352 × __**8 **____**÷**____** 330**__ + 125 - 4 = 214\n\n⇒ 352 × 0.27 + 125 - 4 = 214\n\n⇒ **__95.04__**__** + 125**__ – 4 = 214\n\n⇒ __220.04____ – 4__ = 214\n\n⇒ 216.04 ≠ 214\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) + and ÷\n\nGiven: 352 × 8 − 330 + 125 ÷ 4 = 214\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 352 × 8 − __**330 ÷ 125**__ + 4 = 214\n\n⇒ __**352 × 8**__ − 2.64 + 4 = 214\n\n⇒ __**2816**__ − 2.64 __**+**____** 4**__ = 214\n\n⇒ __2820____ - 2.64__ = 214\n\n⇒ 2817.36 ≠ 214\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) × and ÷\n\nGiven: 352 × 8 − 330 + 125 ÷ 4 = 214\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**352 ÷ 8**__ − 330 + 125 × 4 = 214\n\n⇒ 44 − 330 + __**125 **____**×**____** 4**__ = 214\n\n⇒ __**44**__ − 330 __**+ 500**____** **__= 214\n\n⇒ __**544 − 330**__ = 214\n\n⇒ **214 = 214**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
